# basePath SupplyIntroCh4


:: StartBuilding
@trigger    OnSupplySetupCompleted
@when   !MinigameHasValidSolution()
$call   PointElement(supply:planet_b)
{@PAL}  We have a new source of boron on <color=yellow>Velos station</color>.\n\nFind the station and <color=yellow>HOVER</color> to see the cost.


:: OnPlanetHovered
@trigger    OnPlanetHovered
@when   !MinigameHasValidSolution(), planet == "Planet_B", !temp:checkedPlanetB
$call   ReleaseAllHighlights()
$call   CloseWiki()
{@PAL}  This is cheaper but it comes with risk.\n\nRisk may cost extra time and money.
$wait   2
$call   OpenWikiTo("Routes", "Risk")
$set    temp:checkedPlanetB = true


:: NodeClicked
@trigger    OnNodeClicked
@when   !MinigameHasValidSolution(), node == "Planet_Cu"
$call   CloseWiki()
{@PAL}  This conductor is too expensive. <color=yellow>Choose</color> another.\n\nIf you don't see a cheaper option, <color=yellow>return</color> to RESEARCH to identify one.
$set    temp:checkedPlanetCu = true


:: NodeClickedAfterTryingCopper
@trigger    OnNodeClicked
@when   !MinigameHasValidSolution(), node != "Planet_Cu", temp:checkedPlanetB, temp:checkedPlanetCu
@once
{@PAL}  Build routes to fulfill the requirements.\n\nKeep the time and money low!